  "sticky_button_unlock": "You've reached your first Infinity and unlocked the \"sticky button\" feature! Hold one of the Bottom Buttons for half a second to sticky it.\n\nThe stickied button will keep performing its action when you stop holding it, until you tap it once or sticky another button. The stickied button is highlighted with a circle around it.",
